# #2903 (U28, P16): writer projections stop serving the derived bundle state,
# which clients rebuild from the signed chain. Greenfield flag day, no old
# clients. Remove this entry once main includes the stateless served bundle.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection removed the required property `bundles/additionalProperties/state` from the response with the `200` status

